OL,3,GNEWSABlackpool parrot jungle plan
OL,4,Aknocked back
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn a former ice cream
OL,7,Fparlour in a seaside resort into a
OL,8,Fjungle-themed attraction containing
OL,9,Ffree-flying parrots have been rejected.
OL,11,FThe Talbot Road scheme was described as
OL,12,F"detrimental" to tourism and a "step
OL,13,Fback in time" by Blackpool planners.
OL,15,FAnimal rights organisation Peta had
OL,16,Fraised more than 16,000 signatures
OL,17,Fagainst the proposals put forward by
OL,18,Fbusinessman Przemyslaw Antonowicz - who
OL,19,Fdid not attend the hearing.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
